# upstream.pin: the Upstream_Pin of each Channel (design.md, Data Models).
#
# One line per Channel, fields separated by tabs:
#   <channel>  <commit>  <tag-or-->  <tarball-sha256>
# The tarball is https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy/archive/<commit>.tar.gz.
# tools/vendor fetches it and unpacks it only if its SHA-256 matches.
#
# stable follows Upstream release tags. edge follows Upstream's default
# branch, quattro; it stays at the stable commit until the first edge bump.
